{
  "post": {
    "id": "6010161",
    "published": "2016-05-03T05:38:20.000Z",
    "title": "もももも、も！！",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/6010161.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160505175415/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/6010161.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "申し訳ございませんでした！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "真的非常对不起！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I'm so sorry!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "機械音痴炸裂してカウントダウン開始2日にしてブログ記事更新されず…笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我这个机械白痴又发作了，倒计时才开始第二天，博客文章就没能更新……笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My machine-illiteracy exploded, and on just the 2nd day of the countdown, no blog post went up... lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "予約投稿なんて慣れないことはするもんじゃありませんね。鹿乃はまたひとつ賢く？なりました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "定时发布这种不习惯的事，还真不该随便尝试呢。鹿乃是不是又变聪明了一点？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I guess you shouldn't try unfamiliar things like scheduled posts. Kano has gotten one step smarter (?)."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "というわけで、アルバム発売まであと……8日！今日も収録曲についてはもちろん、最後に深みのまったくない鹿乃のプライベートなお話をしていこうと思います。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么，距离专辑发售还有……8天！今天除了照例聊收录曲，最后还想说说完全没有深度的鹿乃私人话题。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "So, it's 8 days until the album's release! Today too, I'll talk about the songs on it, and at the end, about Kano's private life, which has absolutely no depth."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "youtube",
        "videoId": "GNkPJvVEm0s",
        "watch": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNkPJvVEm0s",
        "video": "5deac0f60979.mp4",
        "cover": "28d89876f134.jpg",
        "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160505175415/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNkPJvVEm0s",
        "coverSource": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/GNkPJvVEm0s/hqdefault.jpg"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アルバム収録曲2曲目は、鹿乃にとってはじめての連続だったこの曲「Stella-rium」ですφ(｡_｡*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "专辑收录曲的第二首《Stella-rium》，是鹿乃第一次为连续播出的动画献唱的歌曲φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The 2nd song on the album is this one, which was a series of firsts for Kano: \"Stella-rium\" φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "実は実は「Stell-rium」というタイトルも鹿乃がつけさせていただいたものだったんです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "其实其实，《Stella-rium》这个歌名，也是由鹿乃来取的哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Actually, actually, the title \"Stella-rium\" was also something I got to come up with myself."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "プラネタリウムやアクアリウムのような感覚で「星のための場所、星をみるための場所」的な名付けになっております。なってると、いいな…φ(｡_｡*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "带着像天文馆、水族馆那样的感觉，给它起了一个“为星星准备的场所、可以看星星的场所”这样的名字。要是真能如此，就太好了呀…φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's named in the spirit of a planetarium or an aquarium, along the lines of \"a place for stars, a place to look at stars\". At least, I hope it comes across that way... φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "放課後のプレアデス 第一巻〈初回限定生産版〉 [Blu-ray]",
            "source": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51QWD808nHL._SL160_.jpg",
            "media": "7127b72a8789.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B00W1HF5DM",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "放課後のプレアデス 第一巻〈初回限定生産版〉 [Blu-ray] [Blu-ray]"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2015-06-24"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "アニメ「放課後のプレアデス」の主題歌になっているこちらの楽曲！ぜひ、アニメともどもよろしくお願いします。アニメを全部観終わってから聴くと、うわあああんってなります。うわあああん！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "这首歌就是动画《放学后的昴星团》的主题曲！请连同动画一起多多关照。把动画全部看完之后再听，会忍不住“呜哇啊啊啊”地喊出来。呜哇啊啊啊！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This song is the theme song of the anime \"Houkago no Pleiades\"! Please look forward to the anime along with it. If you listen to it after finishing the whole anime, it hits you right in the feelings, waaaah! Waaaah!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "個人的な欲望なのですが、プレアデス星人のぬいぐるみ再販しないかな〜〜ってずっと淡い期待を捨てきれずにもっております。大きいの買いたい。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "说点私人的小心愿：昴星团星人的毛绒玩偶能不能再版啊～～我一直抱着这点小小的期待不肯死心。好想买一只大的。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This is a personal wish, but I've never been able to give up my faint hope that they'll reissue the Pleiades alien plush toy. I want to buy a big one."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "【早期購入特典あり】nowhere(メーカー特典:オリジナルポストカード(汎用ver.))",
            "source": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51eVw0AhK-L._SL160_.jpg",
            "media": "48b0ee01baff.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "link",
            "href": "http://www.amazon.co.jp/dp/B01DSN3MU0",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "【早期購入特典あり】nowhere(メーカー特典:オリジナルポストカード(汎用ver.)) [CD]"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "2016-05-11"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "昨日は文化放送さんの「THE CATCH」にお邪魔させていただきましたー！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "昨天去文化放送的《THE CATCH》节目做客啦ー！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Yesterday I stopped by Nippon Cultural Broadcasting's \"THE CATCH\"!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "生ichigoさん、分島さんは美人で優しくてほっこりしておりました。人に気を遣わせずに優しくナチュラルにできる感じ憧れちゃいますね。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "生ichigo小姐和分島小姐都是美人，待人温柔，让人心里暖暖的。那种不用让人拘束、自然而然地温柔相待的感觉，真让人向往呢。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Seeing ichigo and Wakejima in person, they were beautiful, kind and heartwarming. I admire how they can be gentle so naturally, without making anyone feel they have to be considerate."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "またご一緒する機会がありましたらよろしくお願いしますm(_ _)m"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "如果还有机会再次同台，请多多关照m(_ _)m"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If we get the chance to work together again, I'll be in your care m(_ _)m"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "84a94a184351.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/f/c/fc91a319.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "お写真はだーーーーーいぶ、前に遡りますがお土産にいただいたドリアンチョコ。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "照片里的这个，要追溯到很久很久以前了，是别人送给我当伴手礼的榴莲巧克力。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The photo goes waaay back, but it's the durian chocolate I got as a souvenir."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "私のレギュラーラジオを聞いてくださってる方は「ああ！」てなるかもしれません。そうです、これです。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "一直收听我常规广播节目的朋友，可能会恍然大悟“啊！”吧。没错，就是这个。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you listen to my regular radio show, you might go \"Ah!\" Yes, this is it."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "人生初ドリアン…やばいですね。レッドブルで流し込んではみたものの、やばかったです。なにがってにおい！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "人生第一次吃榴莲……实在太猛了。虽然试着用红牛往下灌，结果还是不行。要说不行在哪里——是气味！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "My first durian ever... it's wild. I tried washing it down with Red Bull, but it was wild. What was wild? The smell!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "においが強烈すぎて、肝心の味が美味しかった気がするのですが記憶に残らない笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "因为气味实在太强烈，明明味道好像是不错的，却怎么也留不下记忆。笑"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The smell was so overwhelming that I think it tasted good, but I can't remember it lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "いつか機会があって、好奇心もあったらチャレンジしてみるといいかもしれません。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "如果哪天有机会，又正好有好奇心的话，试着挑战一下或许也不错哦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "If you ever get the chance, and you're curious, you might want to try it."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "それでは、鹿乃でした〜〜またね⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么，这次的鹿乃就到这里啦～下次见⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Well then, that was Kano~ See you!⸜(๑⃙⃘'ᵕ'๑⃙⃘)⸝⋆︎*"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "对对对对、对(不起)！！",
    "titleEn": "Mo-mo-mo-mo, mo!!"
  },
